      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOPPALONGPOG (2) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 3.5 metres from the winner in third over 1730m at this track. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets a similar line up and he can take this out. HOLY CAMP DILLON (8) was in the money at Dubbo two runs ago before finishing eighth at his latest appearance over 2040m at Parkes, beaten 30 metres. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Good enough to take out a race like this. BUTTER CUP (10) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when third at this track over 1730m. Must be included. D J ROCK NZ (3) disappointed last time when ninth over 1609m at Menangle. Can do a lot better so is well worth considering.",
